# Go (WiChat backend)

## Tests live under `test/`

Put test files in a **`test/` subdirectory** next to the code under test — not as `*_test.go` siblings in the production package folder.

```text
wi-shared/exception/
  kind.go
  error.go
  test/
    error_test.go
    kind_test.go
```

- Test package name: **`{pkgname}_test`** (e.g. `exception_test` for `exception/`).
- Import the module under test; tests are **black-box** (exported API only).
- Run: `go test ./...` from the module root (includes `.../test` packages).

**Exception:** tiny white-box tests for unexported helpers — only when unavoidable; keep in `test/` still, or document why a single in-package file is required.

## Formatting and lint

- Format with **gofumpt** and **goimports** (via `golangci-lint fmt`); each module has its own `.golangci.yml` (e.g. `backend/ms-auth/.golangci.yml`).
- Before opening a PR: `cd backend/<module> && make check` (e.g. `ms-auth`, `api-gateway`, `wi-shared`).
- Local dev: `cd backend && make dev-ms-auth` / `make dev-api-gateway` (Air), or `make run-*` without reload; see `backend/Makefile`.
- gRPC contracts: edit `backend/wi-shared/models/**.proto`; run `make proto` from `wi-shared/`; never hand-edit `models/gen/`.
- In `Run(ctx)` and server goroutines: return errors to `main` — no `log.Fatalf` in listeners.

## Other

- Match existing AGPL file headers on new `.go` files.
- Shared errors/responses: `wi-shared/exception`, `wi-shared/response` — see `docs/architecture/error-handling.md`.
- Layer layout (repository / service / delivery): `wichat-go-layers.mdc`.
- Step comments, banners, spacing: `wichat-go-style.mdc`.
- HTTP RED metrics: `wi-shared/infra/metrics.NewHTTPMetrics` + `Middleware` on api-gateway — see `docs/architecture/metrics.md`.
- Inter-service calls: `wi-shared/microservices` (+ `microservices/grpc` for Go gRPC); tracing bootstrap: `wi-shared/infra/otel` — see `docs/architecture/microservices.md` and `tracing.md`.
